{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mUDFbswyr01795429252.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中東局勢持續不穩之際，據報以色列已完成升級「大衛投石索」中程防空系統，擴大攔截範圍。</p><p></p><p>該系統屬於以色列中間層級防空網絡，用於填補短程「鐵穹」和遠程「箭式」之間的防禦空隙。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261123_QQ.DAVIDSLING.CLEAN_007.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262ZwGoUWDvH1795429299.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「大衛投石索」設計最初並非用作專門攔截遠程彈道導彈，去年六月衝突中首次用於攔截由1,500公里外發射的伊朗彈道飛彈，今年較早時，成功擊落大量來襲飛彈，只有少部分攔截失敗，以色列根據實戰數據改進系統。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261123_QQ.DAVIDSLING.CLEAN_006.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cYtHtbTNkK1795429313.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>據報以軍近年傾向用中程「大衛投石索」，而非遠程「箭-3」反導系統，攔截伊朗飛彈，主要是考慮到成本，「大衛投石索」單次發射折合約780萬港元，相比之下，遠程「箭-3」系統單次發射成本明顯更高，需要折合約2,000萬港元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261123_QQ.DAVIDSLING.CLEAN.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kMQcK0Eqkr1795429324.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>以軍消息指，伊朗早前大規模發射彈道導彈暴露以色列防空漏洞，促使以色列短時間內改良「大衛投石索」防空系統。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12646-%E9%9B%85%E7%88%BE%E5%A1%94%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.770388+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:27:32.723532+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:16.421489+00:00","content_hash":"35b82642e4da7526350360fe52cc594ec3b608a1c34316b6fd29dc4fbc40f259","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.770388+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}